{
	chapter.0E21FB2EFB41A583.title: "Minecolonies"
	chapter.231570DE6A7FCD52.title: "When Dungeons Arise"
	chapter.75A5000000000001.title: "Act 0 — Welcome, Otherworlder"
	chapter.75A5010000000001.title: "Act 1 — Reincarnated"
	chapter.75A5020000000001.title: "Act 2 — Paths of Power"
	chapter.75A5030000000001.title: "Act 3 — Monsters Among Monsters"
	chapter.75A5040000000001.title: "Act 4 — Birth of a Nation"
	chapter.75A5050000000001.title: "Act 5 — Beyond This World"
	chapter.75A5060000000001.title: "Act 6 — The Harvest Festival"
	chapter.75A5070000000001.title: "Act 7 — Sovereign Rebirth"
	image.0B2077C083205263.title: "Open the TSR Wiki and Tensura Reference"
	image.0D70F98D1A93C711.title: "Open the TSR Wiki and Tensura Reference"
	image.35B488D7EE336797.title: "Open the TSR Wiki and Tensura Reference"
	image.35B717F36CC43509.title: "Open the TSR Wiki and Tensura Reference"
	image.4B2B27FEF78A6F9F.title: "Open the TSR Wiki and Tensura Reference"
	image.53158143C12AC26B.title: "Open the TSR Wiki and Tensura Reference"
	image.55F07DCEC7748F20.title: "Open the TSR Wiki and Tensura Reference"
	image.7DB3D408AB110655.title: "Open the TSR Wiki and Tensura Reference"
	quest.0331AC0315EBB66D.quest_desc: ["Nestled among the trees, this lively tavern is usually a haven for villagers looking to unwind. Yet when the ale flows too freely, even the most peaceful patrons turn aggressive, defending their pub with surprising ferocity. Enter carefully or risk being caught in a drunken brawl."]
	quest.0331AC0315EBB66D.quest_subtitle: "Find a Greenwood Pub"
	quest.041A1C64A8468087.quest_desc: ["Suspended high in the sky, this arrowhead-shaped airship drifts on a massive aft propeller. Boarding is perilous, but those who succeed will witness its strange and fearsome inhabitants riding boar-like beasts, their eyeless faces obscured by ominous cages. Danger and mystery ride with them across the clouds."]
	quest.041A1C64A8468087.quest_subtitle: "Find a Heavenly Rider"
	quest.0B89EB36AC565461.quest_desc: ["Deep within this subterranean city, the heat of molten lava and the hum of industry dominate the air. The Nether’s influence is strong here, fueling forges and animating Forge Sentinels that patrol every corridor. Only those prepared for fire and steel will survive, and claim the treasures forged within."]
	quest.0B89EB36AC565461.quest_subtitle: "Find a Foundry"
	quest.0CE50A7F4F1A0E4D.quest_desc: ["ladder stretches skyward, disappearing into the clouds. At its top floats a strange, floating vessel. What secrets or dangers await above, none can say… except that the view alone is enough to make even the bravest adventurer’s stomach turn."]
	quest.0CE50A7F4F1A0E4D.quest_subtitle: "Find a Small Blimp"
	quest.14857DBF1DCBF100.quest_desc: ["Cresting the waves like a shadow of the past, this cursed vessel is crewed by skeletons that seem impossible to keep down. Every deck hides danger, every hold whispers of lost treasure and every strike you land may be fleeting. Only the bold (or the foolhardy) dare to face its relentless undead crew."]
	quest.14857DBF1DCBF100.quest_subtitle: "Find an Undead Pirate Ship"
	quest.188AAB5B74C6EAAE.quest_subtitle: "Discover an Infested Temple explorer map"
	quest.1C375606107C117F.quest_subtitle: "Find Keep Kayra"
	quest.1CCA31D9352C60E6.quest_desc: ["Clustered around a towering central “grandmother” mushroom, these villages appear quaint from afar. Yet the villagers within are far more aggressive than their old-world counterparts, hiding a cunning fierceness beneath their colorful caps. Approach with caution as this village may welcome the unwary only to spring its traps."]
	quest.1CCA31D9352C60E6.quest_subtitle: "Find a mushroom village"
	quest.1CEF2A38948010A2.quest_desc: ["Out on the open seas, the &6Illagers&r have taken to the waves, commandeering massive galleys and swift corsairs. Their sails cast long shadows, and their cannons roar with fury. Only the bravest dare to board, for fortune favors those who seize it."]
	quest.1CEF2A38948010A2.quest_subtitle: "Find an Illager Corsair or an Illager Galley"
	quest.1F10BC33D22328BD.quest_desc: ["Time has claimed this once-sacred site, leaving its halls cracked and overgrown. Now, ghostly skeletons and trickster illusioners linger within, guarding little more than shadows of former glory. Though its dangers are real, the temple’s sturdy walls make it a tempting refuge for those seeking a foothold in this hostile world."]
	quest.1F10BC33D22328BD.quest_subtitle: "Find an Abandoned Temple"
	quest.21426F5EEC922866.quest_desc: ["Half-submerged in the oceans lie the petrified remains of a colossal beast, its skeletal form stretching farther than the eye can follow. Was it a creature of the deep, dragged ashore in ages past—or did it fall from the heavens themselves? No records remain, only questions carved into stone."]
	quest.21426F5EEC922866.quest_subtitle: "Find a Typhon"
	quest.2A0A01BE836BB2AB.quest_desc: ["A monument of grandeur and mystery, the Shiraz Palace sprawls in every direction, its halls twisting and turning beyond comprehension. Its purpose remains unknown, but its size and opulence are undeniable. Travelers beware: without a companion, it’s all too easy to lose your way in this labyrinthine estate."]
	quest.2A0A01BE836BB2AB.quest_subtitle: "Find the Shiraz Palace"
	quest.2A1B0386B7987DD3.quest_desc: ["Vast and dreamlike, the Aviary stretches high into wtilight sky, its halls divided into four whimsical quadrants. Each one unfolds as a surreal scene—bright, strange, and perilous in its own way. To wander here feels like stepping beyond reality itself. Is this the journey’s end… or just another beginning?"]
	quest.2A1B0386B7987DD3.quest_subtitle: "Find an Aviary"
	quest.2B70445E6CD99EDB.quest_desc: [
		"Strange structures have begun rising from the land. Mysterious dungeons, fortresses, and towers that pierce the skies. No one knows where they came from, only that they’re teeming with hostile creatures, forgotten treasures, and powerful secrets."
		""
		"Your task is to venture forth and uncover the mysteries of these ancient places. Each dungeon holds new dangers, but also the keys to survival: weapons, artifacts, and knowledge that will aid you in the trials ahead."
		""
		"Prepare yourself adventurer. &6Exploration&r and courage are the only ways to thrive in this world where the land itself rises against you."
	]
	quest.2DB4F395EA26DF4B.quest_subtitle: "Find a Coliseum"
	quest.2EFC5DBD8122A0AE.quest_desc: ["Far below the surface lies a twisted network of chambers, where the air is thick with disease and shadow. Once a place of treatment, it now resembles a burial ground for forgotten rulers, its halls echoing with the whispers of those long lost. Only the brave (or the desperate) dare to tread these haunted corridors."]
	quest.2EFC5DBD8122A0AE.quest_subtitle: "Find a Plague Asylum"
	quest.3D1C0F80B74B27D5.quest_subtitle: "Arrive at a Lighthouse"
	quest.3ECA226F08D5195F.quest_desc: ["Hidden among hills and valleys, the monastery stands as a quiet refuge in a world of rising danger. Here, villagers tend to simple lives of prayer and work, untouched by Illager conquest. Though the halls hold little in the way of treasure, their sturdy walls and peaceful company make this an ideal sanctuary for weary adventurers."]
	quest.3ECA226F08D5195F.quest_subtitle: "Find a Monastery"
	quest.4118927D9D079DC8.quest_desc: ["Rising like jagged thorns from the ground, these massive towers are defended by skeletons entwined with deadly roses. Each level is heavily fortified, and flying rose guards patrol the skies above. Only those who ascend to the top will claim the treasures and secrets hidden within."]
	quest.4118927D9D079DC8.quest_subtitle: "Visit the Thornborn Towers"
	quest.436231715C11E3BA.quest_desc: ["Scattered across the wilds, small bands of Illagers set up camp beneath their distinctive purple tents. Though their supplies are meager and their loot scarce, their presence is a warning, the Illagers’ reach grows wider with every outpost."]
	quest.436231715C11E3BA.quest_subtitle: "Find an Illager Campsite"
	quest.44D115281B0BFB75.quest_desc: ["Whispers speak of a &9flying vessel&r that hovers above the world, shimmering with strange energy. Few dare approach, for those who return tell of eerie lights, warped corridors, and guardians not of this realm. Seek it out, if you dare—and uncover the secrets hidden within its metallic shell."]
	quest.44D115281B0BFB75.quest_subtitle: "Find a Giant Mushroom"
	quest.4791FC0A2E834D85.quest_desc: ["Dark magics linger in the depths of these dungeons, woven into items, halls, and even the very air. Power awaits the bold, but so do twisted fates for the careless."]
	quest.4791FC0A2E834D85.quest_subtitle: "Find a Bathhouse"
	quest.4E4052F7EAD4FDD6.quest_desc: ["Bright banners and painted walls lure travelers closer, but inside these towering strongholds, chaos reigns. Each floor brims with bandits and traps, their laughter echoing as waves of foes pour from endless spawners. Conquer the towers, and their riches—and notoriety—are yours."]
	quest.4E4052F7EAD4FDD6.quest_subtitle: "Find the Bandit Towers"
	quest.509E9CA83FBC780E.quest_subtitle: "Find a Fishing Hut"
	quest.5100CFAD43E7D67A.quest_desc: ["Rising like a monument to conquest, this sprawling fortress serves as a bastion of Illager power. Its many levels are patrolled by raiders and spellcasters, their banners declaring dominion over the land. Within its halls lie chambers of wealth, guarded by Evokers whose magic is as deadly as their stares."]
	quest.5100CFAD43E7D67A.quest_subtitle: "Find an Illager Fort"
	quest.53AF2B722A69DCDC.quest_desc: ["Tucked away in the tall grass, this lonely house stands weathered and broken, its timbers groaning with age. Easy to overlook, it bears little more than the memory of those who once called it home. Still, even the smallest refuge can hold a story."]
	quest.53AF2B722A69DCDC.quest_subtitle: "Find a Small Prairie House"
	quest.541BBC35DA4F0B73.quest_desc: ["Sprouting from a cluster of towering fungi, this outpost of miners has carved their livelihood into the surface world. Ruthless and territorial, they will defend their claim with tooth and nail. Whether the giant mushrooms shield them from the sun or serve some darker purpose, none can say. One truth remains certain: the mine runs rich with ore, for those bold enough to claim it."]
	quest.541BBC35DA4F0B73.quest_subtitle: "Find a Mushroom Mine"
	quest.5C12F4CC1F6F6C32.quest_desc: ["Looming among the clouds, this massive airship bristles with defenses and hostile crew. Phantom-mounted fiends circle overhead, while fish-like raiders astride hoglins stalk the decks. Boarding it is no small feat. Tthose who triumph will etch their name among the few who dared challenge the skies."]
	quest.5C12F4CC1F6F6C32.quest_subtitle: "Find a Heavenly Challenger"
	quest.63116691C92FD576.quest_desc: ["A quiet spring hidden among the hills, its waters swirl mysteriously in the bottomless well. Travelers speak of subtle blessings for those brave enough to approach. Some even report a modest burst of speed for journeys ahead. Whether magic or rumor, the well offers a curious advantage to explorers."]
	quest.63116691C92FD576.quest_subtitle: "Find a Wishing Well"
	quest.6447492FAA873F93.quest_desc: ["Suspended in the sky, this floating steampunk city glows in hues of orange and green. Strange, gear-driven inhabitants roam its platforms, each dominated by a singular central eye or monocle. Enter with caution, this mechanical hive is as clever as it is imposing, and its secrets are tightly guarded."]
	quest.6447492FAA873F93.quest_subtitle: "Find a Mechanical Nest"
	quest.67030CEFEC1CEF37.quest_desc: ["Driven from their villages, these hardy merchants now wander the wilds, taking shelter beneath simple cyan and brown tents. Though weary from exile, they still offer trade and refuge to travelers brave enough to seek them out. In a world rising with danger, such camps are rare havens of trust."]
	quest.67030CEFEC1CEF37.quest_subtitle: "Find a Merchant Campsite"
	quest.6858E25E510AE0FA.quest_desc: ["Drifting through the skies like a colossal squid, this otherworldly airship bristles with defenses. Phantom-riding monstrosities circle its hull, while fish-like warriors astride hoglins guard its decks. To face the Conqueror is to battle a skyborne legion. And only the strongest will claim victory."]
	quest.6858E25E510AE0FA.quest_subtitle: "Find a Heavenly Conqueror"
	quest.6A0237FADC519965.quest_desc: ["From a distance, it looks peaceful. Fields of golden wheat swaying beside a proud windmill. But don’t be deceived: the Illagers tend no crops for trade. Behind the rustic facade lies a nest of evil, their blades as sharp as the sickles they carry."]
	quest.6A0237FADC519965.quest_subtitle: "Find an Illager Windmill"
	quest.6BFE5D35265080E6.quest_desc: ["A sprawling underground stronghold, the Scorched Mines radiate in four cardinal directions from a central dome. Heat and shadows fill the tunnels, and danger lurks at every turn. Brave adventurers who navigate its branching paths may uncover riches, but only if they survive the hazards within."]
	quest.6BFE5D35265080E6.quest_subtitle: "Find the Scorched Mines"
	quest.6CB5ACBAAED66871.quest_desc: ["Shaped from the stem and cap of a giant fungus, this whimsical dwelling offers a rare touch of charm in a perilous world. Lightly guarded and easy to claim, the mushroom house makes for a delightful refuge, perfect for any adventurer who’s ever dreamed of calling a mushroom home."]
	quest.6CB5ACBAAED66871.quest_subtitle: "Find a Mushroom House"
	quest.70327C3AC547B354.quest_desc: ["Marked by its dark prismarine and yellow terracotta roof, this temple has long since fallen to corruption. Inside, swarms of spider-like creatures creep through its halls, striking with venom and ferocity. To enter is to step into a nest where every shadow crawls."]
	quest.70327C3AC547B354.quest_subtitle: "Find an Infested Temple"
	quest.7052C9A5A804E866.quest_desc: ["A riot of color rises from the wilderness, marking the territory of a cunning band of raiders. Their homes are bright and inviting, but enter at your own risk. These defenders strike fast and often. Those who prevail will find spoils and secrets hidden among the lively façades."]
	quest.7052C9A5A804E866.quest_subtitle: "Find a Bandit Village"
	quest.73D5EE5238C37982.quest_desc: ["In the wilds rests the skeletal form of a great creature. its skeleton stretching skyward like branches of pale bone. Whether a relic of forgotten myth or a beast once hunted to extinction, none can say. Its silent frame endures as a monument to creatures long lost."]
	quest.73D5EE5238C37982.quest_subtitle: "Find a Ceryneian Hind"
	quest.75A5000100000001.quest_desc: ["Begin the guided TSR campaign and confirm that you can open and navigate the quest book."]
	quest.75A5000100000001.title: "A New World"
	quest.75A5000100000002.quest_desc: [
		"The crest above every chapter opens the TSR wiki. Use it for pack-specific guidance and the imported Tensura reference."
		""
		"Wiki: https://lastnahaj.github.io/Tensura-Sovereign-Rebirth/"
	]
	quest.75A5000100000002.title: "The Sovereign Archive"
	quest.75A5000100000003.quest_desc: ["Review the default controls before danger finds you. Tensura skill slots use Z, X, and C; the player list remains on Tab; conflicting optional controls begin unbound."]
	quest.75A5000100000003.title: "Take Control"
	quest.75A5000100000004.quest_desc: ["Create or join an FTB Team before shared progression begins. Team membership controls shared quest credit and works alongside the claim system."]
	quest.75A5000100000004.title: "Travel Together"
	quest.75A5000100000005.quest_desc: ["Open the Xaero map and confirm the FTB claim overlay. Claim only the chunks your group needs so shared servers retain room to grow."]
	quest.75A5000100000005.title: "Claim Your Ground"
	quest.75A5000100000006.quest_desc: ["Gather enough wood for tools, storage, and a safe starting shelter."]
	quest.75A5000100000006.title: "First Materials"
	quest.75A5000100000007.quest_desc: ["Craft a workbench. Most TSR systems branch from ordinary survival crafting, so this remains the first reliable progression checkpoint."]
	quest.75A5000100000007.title: "A Place to Work"
	quest.75A5000100000008.quest_desc: ["Place light, storage, and a respawn point. A stable base is more valuable than rushing an unknown boss or dimension."]
	quest.75A5000100000008.title: "Safe Before Strong"
	quest.75A5010100000001.quest_desc: ["Read your race description, innate resistances, Magicule behavior, and visible evolution requirements before choosing a long-term direction."]
	quest.75A5010100000001.title: "Know Your Race"
	quest.75A5010100000002.quest_desc: ["Open the Tensura interfaces and read every starting skill. A new ability can change combat, movement, survival, or evolution requirements."]
	quest.75A5010100000002.title: "Name Your Power"
	quest.75A5010100000003.quest_desc: ["Secure food before pursuing EP, structures, or long-distance exploration."]
	quest.75A5010100000003.title: "Sustainable Life"
	quest.75A5010100000004.quest_desc: ["Build a dependable mining tool and gather stone, coal, and shelter materials."]
	quest.75A5010100000004.title: "Tools of This World"
	quest.75A5010100000005.quest_desc: ["Tensura power does not replace ordinary protection. Gather iron for armor, utility blocks, and early machines."]
	quest.75A5010100000005.title: "Magicules Need Armor"
	quest.75A5010100000006.quest_desc: ["Carry a shield while learning hostile mob and skill behavior. Defensive timing matters more than raw damage early on."]
	quest.75A5010100000006.title: "Stand Your Ground"
	quest.75A5010100000007.quest_desc: ["Earn ordinary experience while watching how EP, Magicules, resistances, and skills progress independently."]
	quest.75A5010100000007.title: "Experience the World"
	quest.75A5010100000008.quest_desc: ["Select a first focus: skills and magic, equipment, guild missions, exploration, or nation building. Optional branches can be revisited later."]
	quest.75A5010100000008.title: "Choose a Direction"
	quest.75A5020100000001.quest_desc: ["Open Great Sage and learn which information it can provide. Voice input remains disabled by default for privacy and stability."]
	quest.75A5020100000001.title: "Consult Great Sage"
	quest.75A5020100000002.quest_desc: ["Keep books available for recipes, enchantments, skill notes, and the broader magic branch."]
	quest.75A5020100000002.title: "Record What You Learn"
	quest.75A5020100000003.quest_desc: ["Build an enchanting table as the vanilla foundation beneath TSR's wider magic and equipment systems."]
	quest.75A5020100000003.title: "An Arcane Foundation"
	quest.75A5020100000004.quest_desc: ["Prepare a dependable weapon before testing new skills. Use the combat style that supports your race and specialization."]
	quest.75A5020100000004.title: "A Weapon You Trust"
	quest.75A5020100000005.quest_desc: ["Craft a Sophisticated Backpack. It is TSR's personal storage layer and can grow without replacing your base storage."]
	quest.75A5020100000005.title: "Carry Your Journey"
	quest.75A5020100000006.quest_desc: ["Craft a Sophisticated Storage chest for organized base inventory. Physical storage remains distinct from terminal access."]
	quest.75A5020100000006.title: "Build Real Storage"
	quest.75A5020100000007.quest_desc: ["Craft Tom's Storage Terminal. TSR keeps Tom's as a terminal and network-access layer rather than a second physical storage family."]
	quest.75A5020100000007.title: "One Network, Many Chests"
	quest.75A5020100000008.quest_desc: ["Review your skills, magic, gear, backpack, and storage plan together. Avoid upgrades that skip the progression path you actually want to test."]
	quest.75A5020100000008.title: "Power With Purpose"
	quest.75A5030100000001.quest_desc: ["Open the Tensura Guild interface and review available progression. Guild work is a guided route into combat without replacing the main campaign."]
	quest.75A5030100000001.title: "Answer the Guild"
	quest.75A5030100000002.quest_desc: ["Craft Nature's Compass and use it carefully. Repeated long-range searches can be expensive while the server is generating terrain."]
	quest.75A5030100000002.title: "Find the Wilds"
	quest.75A5030100000003.quest_desc: ["Craft or acquire a Waystone before distant expeditions. Activate routes deliberately instead of erasing exploration with unrestricted travel."]
	quest.75A5030100000003.title: "Mark the Road Home"
	quest.75A5030100000004.quest_desc: ["Open a generated Lootr container with a teammate and confirm that each player receives a separate inventory."]
	quest.75A5030100000004.title: "Loot for Everyone"
	quest.75A5030100000005.quest_desc: ["Review Beyond Adventures missions and contracts. They provide repeatable adventure work but do not replace TSR's authored campaign."]
	quest.75A5030100000005.title: "Accept a Contract"
	quest.75A5030100000006.quest_desc: ["Bring food, ranged options, spare equipment, and a retreat route before challenging a named or structure boss."]
	quest.75A5030100000006.title: "Prepare the Hunt"
	quest.75A5030100000007.quest_desc: ["Defeat one representative external boss appropriate to your current power. Record missing loot, progression dead ends, or terrain damage as beta findings."]
	quest.75A5030100000007.title: "Challenge a Greater Foe"
	quest.75A5030100000008.quest_desc: ["Store the rewards, repair equipment, and verify the world saves cleanly before beginning a new progression branch."]
	quest.75A5030100000008.title: "Return With Proof"
	quest.75A5040100000001.quest_desc: ["Survey flat space, nearby resources, travel routes, and claimed boundaries before placing a colony. Leave enough room for roads and future districts."]
	quest.75A5040100000001.title: "Choose the Heartland"
	quest.75A5040100000002.quest_desc: ["Craft the Structurize Build Tool used by MineColonies to preview and place schematics."]
	quest.75A5040100000002.title: "The Builder's Scepter"
	quest.75A5040100000003.quest_desc: ["Prepare a Supply Camp to establish the colony's first protected foothold."]
	quest.75A5040100000003.title: "Supply the First Settlers"
	quest.75A5040100000004.quest_desc: ["Craft and place the Town Hall through the Build Tool. Confirm its preview fits inside the intended claim area before committing."]
	quest.75A5040100000004.title: "Raise the Town Hall"
	quest.75A5040100000005.quest_desc: ["Build a Farmer's Delight Cooking Pot as an early communal food-production milestone."]
	quest.75A5040100000005.title: "Feed a Growing People"
	quest.75A5040100000006.quest_desc: ["Give citizens safe paths, housing, food, and physical storage before expanding population or defenses."]
	quest.75A5040100000006.title: "Roads, Beds, Storage"
	quest.75A5040100000007.quest_desc: ["Align the colony footprint with FTB claims and team access. Test a teammate's allowed interaction without granting operator status."]
	quest.75A5040100000007.title: "Borders With Meaning"
	quest.75A5040100000008.quest_desc: ["Complete a stable first district and review Tensura x MineColonies reputation and citizen integration without enabling experimental warfare systems."]
	quest.75A5040100000008.title: "From Colony to Nation"
	quest.75A5050100000001.quest_desc: ["Carry food, blocks, a recovery plan, and a marked return route before crossing a dimension boundary."]
	quest.75A5050100000001.title: "Pack for Another World"
	quest.75A5050100000002.quest_desc: ["Construct and activate a Twilight Forest portal, then confirm the dimension loads without registry or terrain-generation errors."]
	quest.75A5050100000002.title: "Enter the Twilight"
	quest.75A5050100000003.quest_desc: ["Craft a Twilight Forest Magic Map and use it to select a progression-appropriate destination."]
	quest.75A5050100000003.title: "Map the Forest"
	quest.75A5050100000004.quest_desc: ["Construct an Aether portal and verify entry, return travel, and player inventory persistence."]
	quest.75A5050100000004.title: "Climb Into the Aether"
	quest.75A5050100000005.quest_desc: ["Activate a Waystone or establish another safe route near a validated dimension hub."]
	quest.75A5050100000005.title: "Secure the Crossing"
	quest.75A5050100000006.quest_desc: ["Explore one curated structure without assuming every container or encounter is balanced for your current race."]
	quest.75A5050100000006.title: "Structures Worth Finding"
	quest.75A5050100000007.quest_desc: ["Carry an ordinary map as a record of the routes and settlements around your established portals."]
	quest.75A5050100000007.title: "Chart the Unknown"
	quest.75A5050100000008.quest_desc: ["Return to the primary base, unload safely, and confirm all visited dimensions survive a clean server restart."]
	quest.75A5050100000008.title: "Home Through the Gate"
	quest.75A5060100000001.quest_desc: ["Read the current Demon Lord, Hero, soul, and awakening requirements in the TSR wiki before pursuing an irreversible progression milestone."]
	quest.75A5060100000001.title: "Understand Awakening"
	quest.75A5060100000002.quest_desc: ["Gather Blaze Rods for brewing, Eyes of Ender, and late-game preparation."]
	quest.75A5060100000002.title: "Fire of the Nether"
	quest.75A5060100000003.quest_desc: ["Gather three Wither Skeleton Skulls and prepare a controlled arena away from claims and colony infrastructure."]
	quest.75A5060100000003.title: "Skulls of the Withered"
	quest.75A5060100000004.quest_desc: ["Defeat the Wither and recover a Nether Star without allowing the fight to destroy another player's work."]
	quest.75A5060100000004.title: "A Star Is Born"
	quest.75A5060100000005.quest_desc: ["Prepare Eyes of Ender for the route to the End and keep replacements for losses during travel."]
	quest.75A5060100000005.title: "Find the Stronghold"
	quest.75A5060100000006.quest_desc: ["Confirm the exact soul and alignment requirements for your path. Quest rewards never sell completed awakenings or Ultimate Skills."]
	quest.75A5060100000006.title: "Souls Are Not Currency"
	quest.75A5060100000007.quest_desc: ["Coordinate awakening tests with teammates so witness, reward, announcement, and protected-area behavior can be observed safely."]
	quest.75A5060100000007.title: "Witness and Consequence"
	quest.75A5060100000008.quest_desc: ["Reach the appropriate awakening milestone for your chosen path and record the resulting race, skills, stats, and persistence after restart."]
	quest.75A5060100000008.title: "The Festival Begins"
	quest.75A5070100000001.quest_desc: ["Review Ascension's Ultimate awakening path, witness rules, boss mappings, and chamber access before committing rare progression resources."]
	quest.75A5070100000001.title: "Ascend With Intent"
	quest.75A5070100000002.quest_desc: ["Advance a representative Gear Evolution item and verify its components, history, and progress survive logout and server restart."]
	quest.75A5070100000002.title: "Gear That Remembers"
	quest.75A5070100000003.quest_desc: ["Review SlimeThrone Extras prestige and repeatable systems. The authored campaign does not duplicate its large recurring quest pool."]
	quest.75A5070100000003.title: "Prestige, Not Repetition"
	quest.75A5070100000004.quest_desc: ["Reach or evaluate the next Soul Grade threshold and confirm it agrees with your intended endgame path."]
	quest.75A5070100000004.title: "Measure the Soul"
	quest.75A5070100000005.quest_desc: ["Construct a Beacon as a visible sign that the settlement has entered late-game infrastructure."]
	quest.75A5070100000005.title: "A Light for the Realm"
	quest.75A5070100000006.quest_desc: ["Recover the Dragon Egg as proof that the realm can complete vanilla's central boss progression alongside TSR's broader endgame."]
	quest.75A5070100000006.title: "The End Remembered"
	quest.75A5070100000007.quest_desc: ["Verify claims, team roles, colony access, backups, and non-operator permissions before calling the realm multiplayer-ready."]
	quest.75A5070100000007.title: "Rule Responsibly"
	quest.75A5070100000008.quest_desc: ["Complete one full progression loop: reincarnate, evolve, build, awaken, and protect a persistent realm. Continue testing optional branches and report concrete beta findings."]
	quest.75A5070100000008.title: "Sovereign Rebirth"
	quest.76DAECF378BA3F19.quest_desc: ["Far beneath the surface lies a labyrinth of rails and tunnels, carved by long-forgotten hands. The air is thick with dust and danger. Creatures lurk in the shadows, and the echoes of minecarts rattle through the dark. Yet for those who endure, veins of treasure and hidden chambers make the descent worthwhile."]
	quest.76DAECF378BA3F19.quest_subtitle: "Find a Mining System"
